<p>Hi! I am a data journalist living in London, where I <a href="https://www.ft.com/martin-stabe">work for the <em>Financial Times</em></a>. 

<p>This site has links to some of the <a href="/stories/">stories</a> and <a href="/data-visualisation/">data visualisations</a> I have worked on at the <em>Financial Times,</em> plus my neglected old <a href="/blog/">blog</a> and <a href="/links/">curated list of links</a>.</p>

<p>You can find me on <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/martinstabe.ft.com">Bluesky</a>, <a href="https://www.x.com/martinstabe/">Twitter/X</a>, <a href="https://github.com/MartinStabe">Github</a>, <a href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/martinstabe">LinkedIn</a>, <a href="https://www.facebook.com/martinstabe">Facebook</a>, or <a href="https://www.instagram.com/martin.stabe/">Instagram</a>.</p>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section-header">
    <div>
      <h2 class="home-section-title">Stories</h2>
      <p class="home-section-copy">Some of my recent <em>Financial Times</em> data reporting and live data dashboards:</p>
    </div>
    <p class="home-section-cta"><a href="{{ '/stories/' | relativeUrl(page.url) }}">More stories</a></p>
  </div>

  {% if homepage.stories.length > 0 %}
  <div class="home-card-grid home-card-grid--stories">
    {% for story in homepage.stories %}
    <article class="home-card">
      <a class="home-card-image-link home-card-image-link--stories" href="{{ story.link }}">
        <img class="home-card-image home-card-image--cover" src="{{ story.promo_image }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
      </a>
      <div class="home-card-body">
        <p class="home-card-meta">{{ story.pubDate | displayDate }}</p>
        <h3 class="home-card-title"><a href="{{ story.link }}">{{ story.title }}</a></h3>
        {% if story.displayDescription %}
        <p class="home-card-summary">{{ story.displayDescription }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section-header">
    <div>
      <h2 class="home-section-title">Data Visualisation</h2>
      <p class="home-section-copy">Some of my recent data visualisations for <em>Financial Times</em> news stories:</p>
    </div>
    <p class="home-section-cta"><a href="{{ '/data-visualisation/' | relativeUrl(page.url) }}">More data visualisation</a></p>
  </div>

  {% if homepage.graphics.length > 0 %}
  <div class="home-card-grid home-card-grid--graphics">
    {% for graphic in homepage.graphics %}
    <article class="home-card">
      <a class="home-card-image-link home-card-image-link--graphics" href="{{ graphic.flourish_url }}">
        <img class="home-card-image home-card-image--auto" src="{{ graphic.homepage_display_image }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
      </a>
      <div class="home-card-body">
        <p class="home-card-meta">{{ graphic.date | displayDate }}{% if graphic.flourish_template %} • {{ graphic.flourish_template }}{% endif %}</p>
        <h3 class="home-card-title"><a href="{{ graphic.url }}">{{ graphic.story_title }}</a></h3>
        {% if graphic.displayDescription %}
        <p class="home-card-summary">{{ graphic.displayDescription }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>
